==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Zroco]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*3 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*6 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Zory]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Doge]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*6 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to farm money from the Devil Wives at the beginning of the stage, then start building up a huge stack of Long Ranged units like [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]]. The Aku Gories can be dealt with using using high DPS units like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] and/or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]]. Once the giant wall that is Lord Gravey breaks down, you have etfectively beaten the stage.

